Historical native early ramoops target-FDT diagnostic; no new logic.

Apply after kexec_gic_tables_handoff_6.6.89.patch. This packages exactly
the already-built gic-fix/source native-console helper and caller.
CONFIG_KEXEC_NATIVE_RAMOOPS_DIAG defaults n and the exact target token
kexec_diag.early_ramoops=1 is required. Only a clone of the target FDT
is changed after strict source reserved-memory/layout validation.
It disables the vendor consumer and creates the native ramoops node;
the running source FDT is unchanged. Apply later gate, console-flush
and dual-secure-heap-skip patches separately as documented.

